  "definition": "Authority of Presiding Officer",
  "effectiveDate": "2012-07-13",
  "historyNote": "#8044, eff 2-17-04; ss by #10073, INTERIM, eff 1-17-12, EXPIRES: 7-16-12; ss by #10161, eff 7-13-12",
